    REFACTOR-0004: the reports take any Employee
    
    Each report line asked a specific manager for its headcount and total
    salary, written out once per manager. Those are Employee's questions,
    so report() takes an Employee and asks it, without knowing whether it's
    one person or a whole team.
    
    So a single person is reported on exactly the way a team is: Frank,
    a project manager with no reports, gets a line through the same code as
    the CTO's whole org.

diff --git a/src/index.ts b/src/index.ts
